+config BR2_PACKAGE_SIGMASTAR_SENSOR_HEADERS
+	bool
+	help
+	  The Infinity6C sensor-framework headers that match the 1230 MI
+	  drop's mi.ko (ms_cus_sensor with spi_cfg/spi_bus), for
+	  sigmastar-sdk's sensor-src build. sigmastar-sdk selects it when
+	  BR2_SIGMASTAR_SENSOR_SOURCE is set; nothing else uses it.
+
+	  Fetched at a pinned commit of openipc/sensors, the collection
+	  sigmastar-sdk's sensor-src was taken from. The files are
+	  SigmaStar's and carry no license: they are fetched at build
